Seasonal championships.

Battle achievements.

Historical results.

7.5 King of the Arena

A special competitive system can have one King of the Arena.

The champion holds the position until defeated.

The system records:

Current champion.

Reign duration.

Victories.

Successful defences.

Previous champions.

The title follows the same creature identity across awakening.

There is one ladder shared by cats and awakened girls.

A challenge for the throne uses the same paid table. The challenger posts the purse. The champion matches it or stands down. The winner takes the pot after the same percentage. The crown is the record on the life card. It is not a larger share of the odds.

7.6 Later competitions

Further tournaments can be added after the single paid table works.

These can offer seasonal events and exclusive achievements. They use the same engine and the same percentage. They do not introduce a second battle formula.

