Resources.

Special equipment or gameplay items, where appropriate.

Other eligible game collectibles.

CRITTERS can collect a small fee from secondary transactions.

The creature itself remains soulbound at launch.

There is no need for a complicated machine equipment economy.

11.5 Premium events

Special events can generate revenue through optional entry fees or event access.

Examples:

Seasonal championships.

Special Arena events.

Limited-time expedition challenges.

Special community competitions.

Any paid competition with monetary prizes needs legal review in the jurisdictions where it is offered.

11.6 Premium game content

