The backend should be designed to support many creatures without requiring expensive AI calls for every routine action.

14.5 Blockchain verification

The holder verification service should read the official $SOUL token mint and calculate wallet balances.

It should be independent of the AI and game engine.

The game should never trust a balance supplied by the frontend.

14.6 Security

Important protections:

Server-side game validation.

Secure wallet authentication.

Anti-bot and anti-abuse systems.

Rate limiting.

Secure NFT ownership verification.

Protection against duplicate rewards.

Battle result verification.

Secure AI integration.

Separation between AI output and game execution.

The AI must never have unrestricted access to user wallets or smart contracts.

