18. Overall Vision

CRITTERS should become an AI-powered creature ecosystem where every creature has a unique identity and a persistent life.

The player doesn't simply own an image.

They hatch a creature, give it a name, learn its personality, care for it, watch it grow, build its history and eventually witness its awakening.

They can take it into battles, send it on expeditions, train it and compete with other players.

The creature should remain recognisable throughout its entire life.

The blockchain provides ownership. AI provides personality and interaction. The game engine provides progression and rules. The $SOUL token provides additional holder privileges. The business model provides the resources to keep developing the world.

The central product is the living creature. Everything else exists to make its life more interesting.

CRITTERS should first succeed at making people care about their creature. Once that emotional attachment exists, the Arena and Exploration systems give players reasons to stay, while premium AI and optional content give the business sustainable ways to earn revenue.